  "ingredients": [
    "3 eggs",
    "1 cup milk",
    "1 cup all-purpose flour",
    "2 tablespoons butter"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tBQumT5CbncBtDwzhZeqeisx7BI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22539-quick-and-easy-yorkshire-pudding-mfs-step-1-4x3-da876ef714194099b3fe69a973aa150b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22539/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat eggs and milk together in a medium bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ut8Uf961ukMkR3db4zD8NF6xOCk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22539-quick-and-easy-yorkshire-pudding-mfs-step-2-4x3-b24694b40fb640bfa1dfdee2a6bf3a7c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22539/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in flour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BpHlgmVaW1ZN-ibTpNfJZKEm0gs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22539-quick-and-easy-yorkshire-pudding-mfs-step-3-4x3-5cdba2bfd95b40fdbe8fc708d5f4920e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22539/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide butter evenly into the cups of a 12-cup muffin tin, about 1/2 teaspoon per cup.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nbBKItAfpud4JIlPhcvGBceZfu0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22539-quick-and-easy-yorkshire-pudding-mfs-step-4-4x3-df4a8e6e1a77479b8dac38e524c8f48c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22539/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the muffin tin in the preheated oven until butter has melted and is sizzling hot, 2 to 3 minutes. Remove from oven, and distribute batter evenly among each cup.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/R6eYxDxMbQTcnK6aQO9ymjlLTL8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22539-quick-and-easy-yorkshire-pudding-mfs-step-6-4x3-cf988807ea874948a632b43d11d1ba10.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/22539/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return to the oven and bake for 5 minutes. Reduce the heat to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C) and bake until puffed and golden, without peeking, about 25 minutes more. Serve immediately.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tjLJbIm-J1gSgki_3_2eE9Af9OY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/22539-quick-and-easy-yorkshire-pudding-DDMFS-4x3-4286ccfe0041468e9f5203de6b912da1.jpg"
      ],
